function normalized(value){return String(value||'').toLowerCase().normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').replace(/crossbase|cross space|crosspace/g,'crawlspace').replace(/rafters?/g,'rafter').replace(/pipes?/g,'pipe')}
function searchCatalog(query=state.query){
  const terms=normalized(query).split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);
  return state.catalog.map(r=>{
    if(state.category!=='all'&&r.category!==state.category)return null;
    if(state.autoOnly&&String(r.automatic).toLowerCase()!=='yes')return null;
    const service=normalized(r.service),all=normalized([r.service,r.category,r.customer_en,r.customer_es,r.inspector,r.notes].join(' '));
    let score=terms.length?terms.reduce((s,term)=>s+(service.includes(term)?8:all.includes(term)?3:0),0):1;
    if(terms.length&&terms.some(term=>!all.includes(term)))score-=2;
    return score>0?{...r,score}:null
  }).filter(Boolean).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score||a.service.localeCompare(b.service));
}
