  <section class="paint-formulas"><div><span class="eyebrow">${t('PAINTING LABOR MODEL','MODELO DE LABOR DE PINTURA')}</span><h2>${t('Simple enough for the client, exact enough for Management','Simple para el cliente, exacto para Management')}</h2></div><div class="paint-formula-grid"><span><small>${t('Production','Producción')}</small><code>(quantity × coats ÷ rate) + prep + setup</code></span><span><small>${t('Calendar','Calendario')}</small><code>painter-hours ÷ crew size</code></span><span><small>${t('Paint allowance','Allowance de pintura')}</small><code>coated sq ft ÷ 350–400 sq ft/gal</code></span><span><small>${t('Draft hourly view','Vista horaria preliminar')}</small><code>$65–$85 / painter-hour</code></span></div><p>${t('Public ranges are planning estimates. Management controls the approved rate table, visit minimum, actual crew cost and the 40% gross-margin floor. Small jobs may display a fair fixed task price instead of an inflated-looking hourly charge.','Los rangos públicos son estimados. Management controla rates, mínimo de visita, costo real del crew y margen bruto mínimo de 40%. Trabajos pequeños pueden mostrar precio fijo justo en vez de una hora que parezca inflada.')}</p></section>
